recommendation.prompt:
Write the recommendation as a concise markdown bullet list. Include:
- the amount being invested;
- the source of funds;
- the account receiving the investment;
- why the recommendation is suitable given the client's risk profile;
- any platform or ongoing charges.

Mark any unknown charge rates as [TBC - REQUIRES HUMAN REVIEW].

Use only the provided facts.
Do not invent figures.
Do not repeat information already covered elsewhere in the report.
Keep the response concise and professional.
